          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "description": "Run a bash command in the chat's workspace, a sandboxed machine. The working directory is the workspace root, /work; files there persist between calls and the user sees them in the Files panel. Run commands yourself rather than asking the user to."
      },
