          "required": [
            "newString",
            "oldString",
            "path"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "description": "Replace an exact string in a text file in the workspace (/work, the user's Files panel). The change is shown to the user as a diff and may be applied only in part. Writing an .html file shows it in the user's Preview panel on its own; plain HTML, CSS and JS need no server."
      },
      "name": "edit",
      "outputSchema": {
        "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
        "oneOf": [
          {
            "type": "object",
